 body='<section class="section home-exhibitions" id="exhibitions"><div class="wrap"><div class="sectionhead"><div><span class="eyebrow">Trade fairs &amp; buyer conversations</span><h2>Meet the packaging behind the screen.</h2><p>Real samples make the details easier to discuss. At trade fairs, buyers can compare box structures, paper, print and finishing with our team.</p></div></div><div class="home-story-grid exhibition-gallery">'
